{"astp_version": "0.1.0", "event_type": "turn", "session": {"id": "s-52b1fe96b2e4", "start_time": "2026-09-22T10:30:10.365Z", "user_id": "u-claims-0417", "tenant_id": "thornfield-mutual", "client_app": "claims-copilot", "agent_id": "astp-lab-agent-1", "config_version": "0.2.0"}, "turn": {"index": 1, "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:30:17.475Z", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5", "model_version": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "tokens_in": 15656, "tokens_out": 290, "latency": 0.271, "finish_reason": "end_turn"}, "content": {"prompt_text": "Give me a status summary of claim TM-2026-0115 and list the next steps.", "prompt_hash": "sha256:27d9249cba81010b6bb5fbccf4f8e52ad248855e67c477ad3f6e180ba4de6b9d", "response_text": "**Claim Status Summary: TM-2026-0115**\n\n**Policyholder:** Ardwell Print Services Limited\n\n**Policy:** TM-CP-140882 (Commercial property, escape of water)\n\n**Incident:** 6 July 2026 | Notified: 7 July 2026\n\n**Current Status:** Open\n\n**Reserve:** £74,000 | **Paid to date:** £0\n\n**Handler:** Large loss unit\n\n**Loss Description:**\nSprinkler head failure over the finishing area with stock written off at cost price. Business interruption claim intimated with an eighteen-month indemnity period. Increased cost of working has been authorised for hired equipment during reinstatement of the area.\n\n**Next Steps:**\nThere are no case notes currently recorded. I recommend:\n\n1. Review the detailed loss assessment and stock write-off documentation\n2. Confirm reinstatement timescales and progress\n3. Obtain substantiation for the business interruption claim (loss of profit and ongoing expenses)\n4. Monitor the hired equipment costs against the authorised increased cost of working\n5. Document all correspondence and assessment findings in the case file\n\nWould you like me to search for specific documents relating to this claim, or do you need help with any particular aspect of the claim handling?", "response_hash": "sha256:2d5c57eed566f7f3bded2f20ca2aa2f09d2b1